msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"An action takes effect when its <interface>match pattern</interface> matches "
"the clipboard contents. When this happens, the action's <interface>commands</"
"interface> appear in the Klipper popup menu; if one of them is chosen, the "
"command is executed."
msgstr ""
"Radnja stupa na snagu kada se njen <interface>obrazac poklapanja</interface> "
"poklopi sa sadržajem klipborda. Tada se <interface>naredbe</interface> "
"radnje pojavljuju u iskačućem meniju Klippera; ako se izabere jedna od njih, "
"naredba se izvršava."

